Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:54.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,不曾让苍白进占\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And death's pale flag is not advanced there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:56.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌庆祝生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate being celebrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:00.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,有很多事比这更糟  你看罗密欧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are worse tragedies. l mean, look at Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:03.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的愚蠢杀死了自己的真爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed his true love out of sheer stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:06.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.89,0:09:09.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我还是嫉妒他  只因为一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though l do envy him one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  朱丽叶简直完美无瑕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juliet is, like, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:16.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢外表美丽的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf you like that obviously beautiful sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.61,0:09:22.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是因为那个姑娘  是因为自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the girl, the suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:28.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,对于我们种族来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s nearly impossible for…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:32.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,这几乎是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:38.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,对于人类  一点毒药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For humans, a little poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,一把刺进心脏的匕首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a dagger to the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:46.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,可选的方法太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so many different options.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:51.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you say that？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:55.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我曾经想过自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I had to consider it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:09:59.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果没能及时救出你我该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know if I’d get to you in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:03.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我必须要想一些后备计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to come up with some kind of plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.99,0:10:06.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的后备计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the plan？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:10.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会去意大利  激怒沃尔图里家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I’d go to Italy and provoke the Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:13.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 沃尔图里家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The what？ - The Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:16.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在  谁能复述一下最后几句台词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, who'd like to repeat the last few lines of iambic pentameter
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:19.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,以表明他听课了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just to show they were paying attention？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,科林先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Cullen？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的  博迪先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Mr. Berty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:32.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,"在这里  我要安心长眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"O here will I set up my everlasting rest
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.56,0:10:38.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,使这厌倦世俗的肉体挣脱宿命的枷锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and shake the yoke of inauspicious stars from this world-wearied flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:41.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,双眼最后望向你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Eyes, look your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:44.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,双臂最后拥抱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Arms, take your last embrace！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.28,0:10:48.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,在你的双唇  呼吸的所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And, lips, O you, the doors of breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:53.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,印下堂堂正正的一吻  与死神签下永世的契约"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seal with a righteous kiss a dateless bargain to engrossing death！"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:57.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,看屏幕  同学们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes on the screen, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:01.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,就这样  一个亲吻  我走向死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus with a kiss I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:08.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族非常古老  力量非常强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Volturi are a very old, very powerful family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:12.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,是我们世界类似王室的家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l guess they're the closest thing to royalty my world has.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.93,0:11:15.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是卡莱尔吗  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that Carlisle？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:18.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,他和他们一起住了几十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lived with them for a few decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:23.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,说他们很文雅  当然  并不看重人类的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Described them as very refined. No respect for human life, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:27.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,但起码尊重艺术和科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a respect for the arts and the sciences, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:30.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:33.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,法律高于一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Above all, the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:38.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血族也有法律吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires have laws？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:41.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,并不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not very many.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:45.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有一条是必须遵守的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And only one that's regularly enforced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:49.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:53.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,确保我们的存在不为外人所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That we keep the existence of our kind a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:57.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会让自己引人注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't make spectacles of ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.10,0:12:01.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,也不会光天化日下杀戮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we don't kill conspicuously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.57,0:12:08.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然  除非是你自己想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless, of course, you want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:24.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,别再说这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta stop talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:28.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我简直不敢去想有人伤害你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't even think about someone hurting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.97,0:12:35.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  唯一能让我受伤的只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, the only thing that can hurt me is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:39.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他的我无所畏惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't have anything else to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:41.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,可事实不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:46.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,维多利亚吗  总有一天她会来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victoria？She'll come for me one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:51.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝能够看到她的决定  我们可以做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice will see when she decides, and we'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.95,0:12:53.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:56.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你把我变成吸血鬼的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you change me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.29,0:12:59.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  你已经在保护我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, you already do protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:03.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是我继续活下去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my only reason
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:07.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,唯一理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to stay alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:09.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我算是活着的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if that's what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:14.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,保护你不受任何人伤害是我的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's my job to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:20.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,除了我妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From everyone except my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:24.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,开始了  时间到了  要开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s time！It’s time. It’s time. It’s time！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:29.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你唇如荨麻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your lips are nettles
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.78,0:13:31.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你舌似美酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your tongue is wine
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:34.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你像液体般流走  但你身躯如松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're left as liquid. But your body's pine
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.99,0:13:36.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:39.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们试图管住爱丽丝  - 似乎永远不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We tried to rein Alice in. - As if that were even possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:42.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 生日快乐  贝拉  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Happy birthday, Bella. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:48.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在你包里找到的  不介意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it in your bag. You mind？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:51.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,姐弟恋  真新潮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dating an older woman. Hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:55.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了  - 你先来  罗莎莉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What？- You first, Rosalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:01.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,是一条项链  爱丽丝挑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s a necklace. Alice picked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.89,0:14:03.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.85,0:14:07.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,来秀个恩爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.23,0:14:13.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是艾美特送的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's from Emmett.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:18.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,已经装到你的卡车上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already installed it in your truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,那辆破车终于能有个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally a decent sound system
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:22.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 像样的音响了  - 别这么说  又不是车的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- for that piece of… - Hey！Don't hate the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:25.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看埃斯米和卡莱尔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open Esme and Carlisle's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:29.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,是能让你每天都愉快的小玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a little something to brighten your day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:32.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们觉得你最近的脸色不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you've been looking kind of pale lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:41.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,被纸划伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paper cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:09.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,贾斯  贾斯  放松点  只是一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jaz, Jaz. It’s okay. It’s just a little
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:13.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:21.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,把贾斯帕带出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Jasper out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:29.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉  我  我不能再待了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m sorry, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:34.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,去我的工作室我给你缝合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ll have to stitch this up in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:38.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,去看看贾斯帕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check on Jasper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.53,0:15:40.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定对自己非常失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m sure he's very upset with himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:44.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕现在除你以外没人能劝动他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I doubt he'll listen to anyone but you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:45.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:16:00.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我根本就不该来  - 不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l never wanted to have a party. - It’s not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:06.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,贾斯帕还没习惯远离人类的鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jasper hasn't been away from human blood as long as the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:09.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you do it？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:12.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,年复一年的磨练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years and years of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.98,0:16:16.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,难道你就没想过让它顺其自然吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever think of just doing it the easy way？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:19.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:24.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道自己想成为什么样的人  我想要帮助别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew who I wanted to be. I wanted to help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:28.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,这能给我带来快乐  尽管我受到诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It brings me happiness, even if l am damned regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.37,0:16:32.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,诅咒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damned？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.67,0:16:36.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,地狱什么的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like hell？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:45.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔  你没有受诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle, you couldn't be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.68,0:16:47.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没有  不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't. It’s impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.48,0:16:50.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:54.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对我们一直都关怀备至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've always been very gracious about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:17:01.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,就因为这个吗  就因为这个他才不想把我变成吸血鬼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's it？That's why he won't change me？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:07.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,你换过来想想看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine the situation in reverse. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你像爱德华那样对此深信不疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you believed as Edward does,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:15.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意夺走他的灵魂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could you take away his soul？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:40.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你无法永远保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't protect me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:44.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,无法面面俱到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.53,0:17:47.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天  我们会被分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At some point, something's gonna separate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:51.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,可能由于一个意外  或是疾病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s gonna be an accident or illness
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:54.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,或者是因为衰老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or old age,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.17,0:18:00.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要我还是人类就会这样  唯一的办法就是改变我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as long as I’m human. And the only solution is to change me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.05,0:18:05.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,那不是个办法  而是场悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not a solution. That's a tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:09.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,等我变成老太婆时你就不会爱我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna want me when I look like a grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:22.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  我对你的感觉你难道一点都不明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, do you not understand my feelings for you at all？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:27.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔告诉我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle told me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.62,0:18:32.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对自己灵魂的质疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how you feel about your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:36.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,可我不是那么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:39.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要顾虑我的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So don't worry about mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:42.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,你该回屋去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:59.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的生日还没过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s still my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.69,0:19:04.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能提个要求吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So can I ask one thing？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:09.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,吻我好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kiss me？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:46.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.22,0:20:17.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,登上你的塔楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up with your turret
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.73,0:20:23.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,难道我们只是惶恐罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't we just terrified？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:38.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,页岩  将你的担忧掩盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shale, screen your worry
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.91,0:20:43.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,让你无从寻觅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From what you won't ever find
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:21:01.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,别让它愚弄了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let it fool you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.27,0:21:04.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,堕落了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:15.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,陪我走走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just come take a walk with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.56,0:21:41.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要离开福克斯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to leave Forks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.77,0:21:45.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:53.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔的外表本该比现在的老十岁的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlisle's supposed to be 10 years older than he looks,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:55.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,人们慢慢注意到这点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and people are starting to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.24,0:22:02.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我会想办法向查理解释的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I’ve gotta think of something to say to Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.09,0:22:15.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,你说的"我们"是指…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you say "we"…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.18,0:22:22.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,我指的是我家人和我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean my family and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.56,0:22:30.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华  贾斯帕的事  小事而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward, what happened with Jasper, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.48,0:22:33.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错  是小事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. It was nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.78,0:22:38.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,是我一直担心的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing but what l always expected
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.33,0:22:43.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且本该发生比这可怕百倍的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and nothing compared to what could have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.54,0:22:52.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  你只是不属于我的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just don't belong in my world, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:22:59.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我属于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I belong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.89,0:23:03.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,不  你不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:07.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.23,0:23:09.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.82,0:23:13.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不希望你跟着我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不要我了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want me？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:29.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.00,0:23:36.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,这会改变很多事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That changes things a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.93,0:23:40.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你觉得不过分的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it's not too much to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.18,0:23:44.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,能答应我件事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can you just promise me something？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.02,0:23:49.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要鲁莽行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.94,0:23:53.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,算是为了查理吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Charlie's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.15,0:23:58.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,而作为回报  我也承诺一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I’ll promise something to you in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:24:01.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我保证  这是你最后一次见到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the last time you'll ever see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:03.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.58,0:24:07.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再烦打搅你今后的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you can go on with your life without any interference from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.41,0:24:12.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像我从未存在过  我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be like l never existed, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.63,0:24:19.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果是因为我的灵魂  拿去好了  没有你还要灵魂干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf this is about my soul, take it. l don't want it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.47,0:24:21.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,这和你的灵魂无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s not about your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.64,0:24:26.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对我来说  不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just not good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.56,0:24:30.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对你来说不够好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.77,0:24:34.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉  打扰你这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m just sorry l let this go on for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.28,0:24:37.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.15,0:24:40.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.79,0:24:47.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.72,0:25:23.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.53,0:25:27.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:37.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.66,0:27:35.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,我再给科林家打电话问问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m gonna try the Cullens' place again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.08,0:27:39.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 查理  科林一家搬出城了  - 走的真是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Cullens left town, Charlie. - Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.25,0:27:40.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd they go？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:43.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,查理  我们会找到她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find her, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.92,0:27:46.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你  - 查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, Harry. - Charlie！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.89,0:27:52.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,她没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.35,0:27:56.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我来抱吧  谢谢你  山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got her. Thank you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.43,0:28:27.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,(十月)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.31,0:28:51.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 有可能吗 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ There's a possibility ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.43,0:28:54.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,(十一月)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.49,0:28:58.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 我所拥有的 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ All that I had ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.16,0:29:01.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 也是即将得到的 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Was all I’m gonna get ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.75,0:29:10.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝  你消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, you've disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.72,0:29:14.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有一切都消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.93,0:29:18.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还能找谁谈心呢  我很失落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now who else can I talk to？I’m lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.64,0:29:24.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,(十二月)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.73,0:29:27.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,你离开的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you left,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.28,0:29:30.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,他也离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he left,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:35.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,你把一切都带走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you took everything with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.62,0:29:40.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,满眼望去  都没有他的身影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the absence of him is everywhere I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.05,0:29:51.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像我的胸膛被挖了一个巨大的洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s like a huge hole has been punched through my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.18,0:29:58.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.49,0:30:16.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,可我还是很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in a way I’m glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.07,0:30:20.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦提醒着我他曾经存在过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pain is my only reminder that he was real,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.29,0:30:21.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们都曾经存在过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you all were.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.63,0:30:32.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,好了  就这么定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.51,0:30:36.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.05,0:30:40.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,回杰克森维尔和你妈妈一起住吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to Jacksonville to live with your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.68,0:30:44.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会离开福克斯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m not leaving Forks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.02,0:30:49.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝尔  他不会回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bells, he's not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.90,0:30:54.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.36,0:30:58.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的行为很不正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s just not normal, this behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.87,0:31:02.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,老实说  我被你吓坏了  你妈妈也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite frankly, it's scaring the hell out of me and your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.37,0:31:06.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝  我也不想你离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby, I don't want you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.04,0:31:11.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不想  但是  回杰克森维尔吧  交些新朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't, but just go. Go to Jacksonville. Make some new friends.
