Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.21,0:32:35.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你那么消沉  我非常非常担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, your depression thing, I get it. I’m totally, totally worried.
