Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.09,0:32:40.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  我也经历过一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}…and I’m going through stuff, too. You know？Like Mike deciding
