Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.29,0:35:14.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想我看到了一些东西  - 你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l thought that l saw something. - You… Oh.
