Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:55.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果冲动地冒险能让我见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If a rush of danger is what it takes to see him,
