Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.32,0:38:30.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,而你柔弱无力且缺乏基本知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because of your general paleness and lack of know-how.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.90,0:38:33.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说服你帮我组装这个两轮杀人机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I convinced you to build two-wheeled death machines with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.49,0:38:37.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得这让你很滑稽很幼稚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think that makes you kind of young and naive？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.12,0:38:39.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  那你觉得应该怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. So where do we stand？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.33,0:38:44.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果我35岁的话  你最多是32岁  - 不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I’m 35. And you might be, like, 32. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.50,0:38:48.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 雅各  在家吗  - 没关系  哥们儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo, Jake, you in there？- It’s okay. It’s just my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.17,0:38:50.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿  雅各  - 伙计们  这是贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Jake. - Hey. Guys, this is Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.00,0:38:53.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  奎尔和恩布里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, that's Quil and Embry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.22,0:38:56.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我叫奎尔·安特拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m Quil Ateara.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.10,0:39:00.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么修摩托车的事是真的咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the bike building story is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.10,0:39:02.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错  这些都是我教他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, yeah, I taught him everything he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.27,0:39:05.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,关于你是他女朋友那部分呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the part where you're his girlfriend？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.77,0:39:08.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're friends, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.69,0:39:10.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,露馅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.40,0:39:13.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我记得我说过她只是我的女性朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, remember I said she's a girl and a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.36,0:39:15.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,恩布里  当时他说得有这么清楚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Embry, do you remember him making that distinction？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.32,0:39:16.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.36,0:39:18.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是说你们都有女朋友  很不错嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you guys have girlfriends？That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.12,0:39:23.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  不错  奎尔带去舞会的那个其实是他表妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right. Quil's actually taking his cousin to prom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.29,0:39:25.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错  依旧很好笑是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's still a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.54,0:39:28.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想找乐子吗  我就给你点乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want funny, Black？I’ll give you funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.84,0:39:31.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.21,0:39:32.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你违规\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, that hold's illegal！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.63,0:39:34.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我押5美元赌奎尔赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got five bucks on Quil.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.97,0:39:36.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你赢定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.39,0:39:42.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有的宇航员  香槟在塑料杯里泛光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of the astronauts. Champagne in plastic cups
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.93,0:39:47.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,等待着大人物登场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting for the big hero to show
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.39,0:39:52.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,他就站在门外  手托腮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outside the door he stands. His head in his hands
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.57,0:39:55.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,心快蹦出喉咙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his heart in his throat
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.74,0:39:58.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,他要告诉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can he tell them now
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.11,0:40:00.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear Alice,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.45,0:40:02.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,真希望有你的真实地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I had your real address.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.24,0:40:05.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很想告诉你关于雅各的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could tell you about Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.08,0:40:08.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,他让我感觉好了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.46,0:40:11.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,是他给了我生机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he makes me feel alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.46,0:40:16.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我胸膛上的洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hole in my chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.26,0:40:21.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我和雅各相处的时候  差不多已经愈合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, when I’m with Jake, it's like it's almost healed
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.85,0:40:24.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,暂时地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.43,0:40:28.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,奎尔总嚷嚷着要过来  我觉得他有点过于喜欢你了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Quil keeps asking to come over. I think he likes you a little too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.15,0:40:34.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不想卷进什么帅哥风波\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I’m really not into the whole cougar thing. You know？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.11,0:40:39.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,最近怎么一提年龄你就不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up with you and age？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.61,0:40:42.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是说那个科林究竟几岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, how old was that Cullen guy, anyway？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.16,0:40:48.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,可是就连雅各也不能赶走我的噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But even Jake can't keep the dreams away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.13,0:41:00.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒  贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.38,0:41:03.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,没事了  没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.15,0:41:18.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我本以为这东西有用的  看来我猜错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought this thing was starting to work, but I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.95,0:41:26.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你点事儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I ask you something？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.00,0:41:30.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,和雅各布相处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hanging out with Jacob,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.83,0:41:35.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,的确让你稍微摆脱了那些噩梦  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that seems to take your mind off things a bit, doesn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.59,0:41:42.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道  有些时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.26,0:41:47.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,人需要学会珍惜那些对你好的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you gotta learn to love what's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.31,0:41:50.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.64,0:41:54.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然  我又知道什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, what do I know？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.06,0:41:57.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是个无可救药的单身汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m just a terminal bachelor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.65,0:42:01.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,超有女人缘的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Famous ladies' man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.20,0:42:05.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.20,0:42:08.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我去睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m gonna go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.04,0:42:12.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.59,0:42:23.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你  我修不好这些车  你会说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf l told you l couldn't have fixed these bikes, what would you have said？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.55,0:42:27.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在怀疑自己的技术吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you doubting your mad skills？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.64,0:42:32.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然不是  很快就能好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Definitely not. I mean, they'll run fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.93,0:42:34.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s just,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.27,0:42:40.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果聪明的话  我应该拖一拖再修好它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe if I was smart, I would have dragged out the rebuild a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.24,0:42:49.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你告诉我你修不好这些车的话  我应该会说  那真是太糟糕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you told me you couldn't fix these bikes, I would say that that's really too bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.33,0:42:53.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,但咱们可以找点其他事来做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that we're just gonna have to find something else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.38,0:43:00.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是山姆·尤里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Sam Uley？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.09,0:43:03.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,恩  他和他的小弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Him and his cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.34,0:43:07.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.89,0:43:12.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,看见没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.36,0:43:22.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们不是真在打架  贝拉  他们在玩悬崖跳水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not really fighting, Bella. They're cliff diving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.28,0:43:24.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怖之极  但绝对够刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scary as hell, but a total rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.07,0:43:30.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 刺激  - 我们只从低处往下跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A rush？- Most of us jump from lower down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.95,0:43:34.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,好让山姆和他手下去炫耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We leave the showing off to Sam and his disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.50,0:43:39.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对他有不满吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have some kind of beef with him or something？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.96,0:43:42.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.55,0:43:45.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们自认统治着这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They just think they run this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.55,0:43:48.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,恩布里把他们自己称为猛男纠察队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Embry used to call them hall monitors on steroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.51,0:43:50.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 看他  - 那是恩布里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now look at him. - That's Embry？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.81,0:43:55.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 恩  - 他怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - What happened to him？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.64,0:43:57.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,他经常翘课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He missed some school.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.27,0:44:01.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,一夜之间就变成了山姆的跟屁虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now all of a sudden, he started following Sam around like a little puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.44,0:44:04.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,保罗和杰拉德也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same thing happened with Paul and Jared.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.74,0:44:07.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,山姆看我的眼神怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam keeps giving me this look,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.11,0:44:11.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,就好象他一直在等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like he's waiting for me or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.12,0:44:15.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,快把我弄疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s kind of starting to freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.91,0:44:18.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就离他远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you should just avoid him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.33,0:44:21.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.81,0:44:40.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.23,0:44:45.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看上去很害怕啊  - 才没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look scared. - I’m not.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.82,0:44:48.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.20,0:44:50.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 刹车  - 握住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brake？- That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.53,0:44:54.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,离合器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clutch？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.99,0:44:56.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.54,0:44:57.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,油门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.17,0:45:01.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.54,0:45:05.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在慢慢放开离合器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, slowly release the clutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.63,0:45:08.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.39,0:45:13.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.73,0:45:20.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.60,0:45:23.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要再试一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m gonna go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.81,0:45:24.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.75,0:45:45.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,快刹车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the brake！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.85,0:46:00.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想再试一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna go again.
