Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.27,1:02:07.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 请别这样  你帮过我们  - 不  不  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please, don't. l mean, you helped us. - No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.19,1:02:12.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕  我这样正是在帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be afraid. I’m doing you a kindness.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.74,1:02:15.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,维多利亚计划要慢慢折磨死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victoria plans on killing you slowly,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.70,1:02:18.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,摧残你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}painfully,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.99,1:02:21.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会干脆些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whereas I’ll make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.58,1:02:22.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.96,1:02:25.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都不会感觉到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will feel nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.72,1:02:33.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华  我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward, l love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.72,1:02:37.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.46,1:03:47.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸  我看见它们了  - 看到什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dad！l saw them. - What's the matter？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.08,1:03:50.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 在森林里  他们不是熊  - 什么叫"在森林里"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In the woods. They're not bears. - What do you mean "in the woods"？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.17,1:03:51.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  你去森林里干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bell, what the hell were you doing out in the woods？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.00,1:03:55.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,是狼  非常巨大的狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're wolves. l mean, they're like huge wolves.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.80,1:03:57.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗  贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure about that, Bella？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.72,1:04:00.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我刚才看到了  他们在追  什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah！l just saw them. They were after something.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.14,1:04:03.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,狼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wolves？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.52,1:04:06.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看见了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw them？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.65,1:04:11.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  哈利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, well, Harry,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.48,1:04:15.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,咱们去围捕它们  你能叫上些人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feel like going hunting？Get some of your guys together？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.28,1:04:18.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,没问题  我只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, yeah, I’ll just…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.07,1:04:21.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道那些狼肯定会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By now, those wolves will be dead,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.54,1:04:26.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,劳伦特会告诉她  没人保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Laurent would have told her I’m unprotected.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.66,1:04:27.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,维多利亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.67,1:04:31.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得去警局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l should go to the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.21,1:04:33.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,是  你该去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you should. You should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.30,1:04:36.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,待在家里别出去好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you just stay in the house？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.70,1:05:02.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.62,1:05:07.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,你吓坏我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You scared me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.12,1:05:10.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来干什么  - 退后  我要上来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell are you doing？- Back up. I’m coming up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.22,1:05:27.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,听着  我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.98,1:05:37.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么道歉  - 我希望我能解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For what？- l wish l could explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.36,1:05:40.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,可是  我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But l literally can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.25,1:05:52.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有过不可告人的秘密吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever had a secret you couldn't tell anyone,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.54,1:05:56.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且那秘密还不是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one that wasn't yours to share？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.92,1:06:01.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我现在的处境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's what it's like for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.72,1:06:03.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,或者更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.43,1:06:07.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,你无法理解我是多么的煎熬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea how tight I’m bound.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.97,1:06:10.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l hate this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.35,1:06:13.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我恨他们对你做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l hate what they've done to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.83,1:06:30.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我纠结的事你其实是知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l mean, the killer part is, you already know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.00,1:06:39.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  你还记得咱们在拉布什海滩散步的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, do you remember when we walked on the beach at La Push？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.26,1:06:42.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.55,1:06:49.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,那个故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story. The story about
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.52,1:06:52.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,关于冷血生灵的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the cold ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.89,1:06:57.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想我能理解为什么你只记得那一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l guess l understand why that's the only part you remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.66,1:07:08.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定可以做些什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gotta be something that you can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.58,1:07:10.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,不  这是我的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I’m in it for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.04,1:07:14.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,或许咱们可以离开这里一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe we should just get out of here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.75,1:07:16.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,就这么离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.71,1:07:18.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有你和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.75,1:07:20.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd do that？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.51,1:07:25.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了你  我愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l would do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.72,1:07:35.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,这不是逃避就能解决的问题  贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s not something l can just run away from, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.06,1:07:39.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,但如果可以的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But l would run away with you
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.82,1:07:45.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意和你一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if l could.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.37,1:07:52.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我该走了  他们会起疑心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l gotta go. They'll start wondering where l am.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.75,1:07:58.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.50,1:08:03.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.84,1:08:06.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,试着想起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.26,1:08:10.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be so much easier
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.60,1:08:13.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,事情会简单很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.68,1:08:18.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会的  可是  雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ll try. But, Jake…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.02,1:08:21.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各  你要做什么  等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake, what are you doing？Wait, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.91,1:08:30.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.97,1:08:48.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华  我很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward, I’m scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.30,1:08:50.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,你应该感到害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.97,1:08:57.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,那确实只是个古老的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, it's just like an old story.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.98,1:08:59.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不该跟别人透露这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m not really supposed to say anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.94,1:09:03.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗  奎鲁特人经常被认为是狼人的后裔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know Quileutes are supposedly descended from wolves？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.58,1:09:19.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.25,1:09:22.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l need to see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.71,1:09:24.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.92,1:09:29.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  我必须要见到他  - 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, I’m sorry, l really need to see him.  - Bella！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.19,1:09:46.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.86,1:09:48.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们究竟做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what did you do？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.99,1:09:50.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们对他做了什么  - 冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you do to him？ - Easy！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.45,1:09:51.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不想要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.57,1:09:53.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们做了什么  他做了什么  他跟你说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did we do？What did he do？What'd he tell you？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.03,1:09:55.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们两个都冷静点  - 他什么都没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Both of you calm down.  - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.53,1:09:58.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,他什么都不敢说  因为他害怕你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tells me nothing because he's scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.75,1:10:05.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 来不及了  - 贝拉  快退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Too late now.  - SAM: Bella, get back！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.88,1:10:09.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,保罗  冷静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paul, calm down, now！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.22,1:10:19.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.73,1:10:21.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.06,1:10:26.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各  快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake, run！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.59,1:10:53.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,保罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paul！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.44,1:11:07.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,把贝拉带回艾米丽那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey！Take Bella back to Emily's place.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.77,1:11:11.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,狼人的秘密被揭穿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess the wolf's out of the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.20,1:11:20.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝  这一切都是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, is it possible that everything is true？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.79,1:11:23.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,童话和恐怖故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fairy tales and horror stories？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.25,1:11:26.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,难道这世上的一切都是异常又疯狂的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it possible that there isn't anything sane or normal at all？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.96,1:11:30.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,咱们应该回去看看雅各布怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, l think we should go back and see if Jacob's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.96,1:11:33.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,保罗真该好好咬他一通  给他点教训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l hope Paul sinks some teeth in him. Serves him right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.67,1:11:35.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,不可能  雅各布天生勇猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way. Jacob's a natural.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.55,1:11:39.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你刚看到他腾空变身了吗  我赌五美元  保罗连他的汗毛都碰不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see him phase on the fly？l got five says Paul doesn't touch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.35,1:11:41.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧  贝拉  我们不咬人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in, Bella. We won't bite.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.14,1:11:43.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可没说不咬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.10,1:11:47.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的过错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l done me wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.15,1:11:49.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,毁了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And done all wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.57,1:11:53.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的过错  要自己承担\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the wrong I’ve done I’m sure I’ll live quite long
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.65,1:11:58.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾米丽是山姆的未婚妻  别盯着她看  山姆会难堪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey, about Emily, Sam's fiancée？Don't stare. It bugs Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.87,1:12:02.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要盯着她看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would l stare？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.66,1:12:05.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们饿了吗  这还用问吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you guys hungry？Like l have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.17,1:12:14.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's this？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.84,1:12:16.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉·斯旺  还能有谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella Swan. Who else？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.47,1:12:21.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,原来你就是那个吸血鬼女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're the vampire girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.77,1:12:26.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么你是狼人女孩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're the wolf girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.69,1:12:31.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess so.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.19,1:12:33.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我和其中一个订婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I’m engaged to one.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.11,1:12:41.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,给你们的兄弟留点  女士优先  来点松饼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save some for your brothers. And ladies first. Muffin？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.70,1:12:44.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,好的  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.24,1:12:47.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,让雅各去想怎么对山姆解释违约的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave it to Jacob to find a way around Sam's gag order.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.54,1:12:50.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,他什么都没告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't say anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.54,1:12:51.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是狼人的规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a wolf thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.79,1:12:54.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,不管你喜不喜欢  一定要听首领的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha's orders get obeyed whether we want them to or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.38,1:12:56.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,不信你可以试试  我们能听到同伴的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And check it out. We can hear each other's thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.72,1:13:00.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就不能闭会儿嘴吗  这些可是机密  该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you shut up？These are trade secrets. Damn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.89,1:13:03.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,这妞和吸血鬼一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This chick runs with vampires.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.22,1:13:06.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,其实我没法和他们在一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't really run with vampires.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.77,1:13:10.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们跑的太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause they're fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.90,1:13:13.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗  我们更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah？Well, we're faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.07,1:13:16.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在害怕了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freaked out yet？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.45,1:13:20.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我又不是第一次看见怪兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the first monsters I’ve met.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.91,1:13:23.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各说得对  你已经见怪不怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake's right. You're good with weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.10,1:13:47.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.91,1:14:03.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么  你是个狼人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're a werewolf？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.58,1:14:07.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,是  上次验证过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Last time l checked.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.21,1:14:13.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,族里只有少数幸运儿拥有这种血统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few lucky members of the tribe have the gene.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.63,1:14:17.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果城里有吸血鬼  我们就会发烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bloodsucker moves into town and the fever sets in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.05,1:14:21.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,传染性腺热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mono.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.88,1:14:24.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我倒希望是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. l wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.68,1:14:31.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有办法停止这些吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, can't you find a way to just stop？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.31,1:14:36.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是不对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l mean, it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.90,1:14:41.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,这不像选择生活方式  贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s not a lifestyle choice, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.86,1:14:44.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们生来如此  没得选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l was born this way. l can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.66,1:14:47.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个伪君子  你不能接受我这种怪物吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're such a hypocrite. What, I’m not the right kind of monster for you？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.91,1:14:49.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,这和你是谁无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s not what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.25,1:14:53.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,关键是你做了什么  他们从来不伤害别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s what you do. They never hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.04,1:14:57.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,而你们却杀人  雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've killed people, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.54,1:14:59.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  我们没有杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, we're not killing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.01,1:15:03.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then who is？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.51,1:15:06.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了保护你们人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we're trying to protect you people from,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.72,1:15:08.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们唯一会杀的就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only thing we do kill,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.22,1:15:12.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,死血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}vampires.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.02,1:15:15.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等  雅各  你不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Jake, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.19,1:15:17.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,放心  我们不会伤害你的宝贝爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. We can't touch your little precious Cullens
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.52,1:15:19.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,除非他们违反约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless they violate the treaty.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.53,1:15:22.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not what I’m saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.99,1:15:25.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们杀不了吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't kill vampires. They'll…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.03,1:15:27.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们会杀了你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.87,1:15:31.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗  我们试过了  杀掉他们很容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really？We took out that leech with the dreads easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.71,1:15:36.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是说劳伦特吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laurent？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.92,1:15:39.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的红发女友会是下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And his red-headed girlfriend is next.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.05,1:15:41.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,维多利亚在这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victoria's here？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.50,1:15:44.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,她来过  有一晚我们一直追杀她到加拿大边境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was. We chased her all the way to the Canadian border the other night.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.59,1:15:48.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,但她不断跑回来  我们不知道她在寻找什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She keeps coming back. We don't know what she's after.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.09,1:15:49.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l do.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.81,1:15:53.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.07,1:16:05.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,别担心  我们会守卫这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. We've got this place covered.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.57,1:16:09.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,不会让她接近你和查理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't get near you or Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.57,1:16:11.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you've got to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.41,1:16:14.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,她速度很快的  快得难以想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's fast. You don't know how fast she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.58,1:16:18.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗  对我们这么没信心是一种侮辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, your lack of confidence in us is a little insulting.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.96,1:16:21.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,好了  我该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I’d better go.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.21,1:16:24.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要走了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta go？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.67,1:16:26.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.59,1:16:29.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,去杀吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a vampire to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.36,1:16:45.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝  我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice, I’m all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.57,1:16:49.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,除了孤身一人的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until I’m alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.62,1:16:53.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,而最近尤其如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And lately, that's all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.49,1:16:56.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布走了  去追杀维多利亚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob's gone. He's hunting Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.29,1:16:58.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,而查理在追查雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Charlie's hunting Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.62,1:17:00.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你又不在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.29,1:17:03.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华也走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so is Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.05,1:17:09.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我现在一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's just nothing now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.47,1:17:14.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,哈利  你发现什么了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got something, Harry？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.68,1:17:17.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,没  什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.98,1:17:26.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道要到去往何处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But l realize where l have to go,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.99,1:17:29.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道怎样做才能再见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what l have to do to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.33,1:17:43.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,脑海中的眼泪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A tear in my brain
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.34,1:17:52.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,让声音蜂拥而入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allows the voices in
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.35,1:18:02.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们要把你推下轨道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanna push you off the path
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.40,1:18:10.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,用那频率的脉冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With their frequency wires
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.33,1:18:22.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没有错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can do no wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.34,1:18:34.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我眼中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my eyes
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.10,1:18:40.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没有错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do no wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.86,1:18:53.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我眼中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my eyes
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.53,1:18:57.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,醉酒的推销员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A drunken salesman
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.66,1:18:59.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你听力损伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hearing damage
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.66,1:19:01.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,你心事重重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mind is restless
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.62,1:19:03.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们说你会痊愈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say you're getting better
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.79,1:19:07.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,可你却越陷越深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't feel any better
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.13,1:19:16.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,话筒在爆炸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your speakers are blowing
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.26,1:19:18.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,震耳欲聋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ears are wrecking
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.43,1:19:20.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你听力损伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your hearing damage
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.43,1:19:24.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,但愿一切会好起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wish you felt better
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.03,1:19:36.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没有错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do no wrong
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.95,1:19:52.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,在我眼中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my eyes
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.50,1:20:29.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.01,1:20:36.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我做人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted me to be human.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.64,1:20:39.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.72,1:20:44.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.31,1:20:46.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.39,1:20:49.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有这样你才能和我在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't stay with me any other way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.77,1:20:53.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.17,1:22:02.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,余音不绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This constant noise all the time
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.06,1:22:18.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是我眼中的全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though you're the only one l see
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.90,1:22:23.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.91,1:22:25.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.62,1:22:29.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  醒过来  呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bella, breathe！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.75,1:22:39.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  能听到我说话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella？Bella, can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.72,1:22:47.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.51,1:22:49.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.31,1:22:57.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你到底想干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell were you thinking？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.82,1:23:01.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想看一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l just wanted to see something.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.49,1:23:05.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,送她回家  我要去去哈利家帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her home！I’m gonna go help out over at Harry's place.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.20,1:23:10.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,哈利家怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened at Harry's？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.50,1:23:13.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,哈利心脏病突发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harry Clearwater had a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.83,1:23:16.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,查理和我爸爸都到他家去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie and my dad are over at his place with his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.50,1:23:18.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,他还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.17,1:23:21.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,他去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.22,1:23:28.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,来  我帮你把身上弄干然后送你回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I’ll get you something dry and drive you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.94,1:23:42.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我身上暖得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}108 degrees over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.40,1:23:45.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.74,1:23:48.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的手都快冻僵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hands are freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.83,1:23:53.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,从来都不怕冷的感觉一定很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be nice, never getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.70,1:23:55.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,狼人都是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s a wolf thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.21,1:23:57.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s not.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.21,1:24:00.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有雅各布很温暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Jacob thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.55,1:24:02.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真的很温暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.76,1:24:06.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像是  自己的太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're like your own sun.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.30,1:24:14.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,太好了  现在你已经了解我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is better, now that you know about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.35,1:24:18.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.86,1:24:26.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看到艾米丽的样子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw what happened to Emily.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.57,1:24:31.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,山姆当时很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam got angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.08,1:24:34.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,仅仅因为一秒钟的情绪失控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost it for a split second.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.71,1:24:37.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,而艾米站得离他太近了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Em was standing too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.21,1:24:42.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,造成永远无法弥补的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll never be able to take that back.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.55,1:24:47.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,万一我突然对你生气怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if l got mad at you？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.02,1:25:00.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,有些时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.07,1:25:05.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉自己快要消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l feel like I’m gonna disappear.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.20,1:25:14.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是因为你想听我才说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, not that you need me
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.12,1:25:17.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我永远都会这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tell you something like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.08,1:25:22.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不会失去自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but l always will. You're not gonna lose yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.59,1:25:27.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让那发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l wouldn't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.01,1:25:31.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.72,1:25:37.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会一直对你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ll tell you all the time
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.65,1:25:42.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有多特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how special you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.12,1:26:04.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  为我做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. For everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.38,1:26:12.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.35,1:26:17.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,这儿有个吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.52,1:26:19.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.48,1:26:22.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能闻出来  我要带你离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l can smell it. I’m getting you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.35,1:26:24.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是卡莱尔的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Carlisle's car.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.44,1:26:27.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.32,1:26:31.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  这是个陷阱  别去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, it's a trick！Stop！You gotta come with me！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.41,1:26:37.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会伤害我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.12,1:26:40.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果科林回来的话  那这里就是他们的辖区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf a Cullen is back here, this is their territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.96,1:26:43.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,按照合约我们只能保卫自己的领地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treaty says we can only defend on our own lands.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.46,1:26:47.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 在这里我没法保护你  - 好  没事的  你没必要保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l can't protect you here. - Okay. That's okay. You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.05,1:26:51.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你越界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about to cross a line.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.88,1:26:53.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就别分界线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then don't draw one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.09,1:26:55.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.28,1:27:13.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.78,1:27:16.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊  你怎么…  - 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, my God！What are you…  - Bella！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.99,1:27:21.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  我只是无法相信你会在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m sorry, l just, l can't believe you're here. Is…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.25,1:27:24.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,可以给我解释一下你为什么还活着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to explain to me how you're alive？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.29,1:27:26.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.42,1:27:29.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你跳崖了  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l saw a vision of you. You jumped off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.55,1:27:32.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why in the hell would you try and kill yourself？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.76,1:27:33.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,查理怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l mean, what about Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.97,1:27:36.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有…  - 我没有想自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about…  - l didn't try to kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.80,1:27:38.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是悬崖跳水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was cliff jumping.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.35,1:27:40.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,消遣而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recreationally.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.18,1:27:41.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,很有趣的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.81,1:27:47.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从来没见过这么玩命的傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l have never met anyone more prone to life-threatening idiocy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.32,1:27:54.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.99,1:27:57.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉他了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you tell him？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.11,1:27:58.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.87,1:28:02.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,他只是每隔几个月来一个电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He only calls in once every few months.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.21,1:28:06.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说他想一个人待着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he wants to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.30,1:28:15.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  为什么会有这么大的狗臭味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, what is that God-awful wet dog smell？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.97,1:28:20.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's probably me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.72,1:28:23.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,或是雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or it's Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.23,1:28:26.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁是雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob who？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.98,1:28:30.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布是狼人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob's kind of a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.69,1:28:34.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  不要和狼人交朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella！Werewolves are not good company to keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.11,1:28:37.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用你替她做主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.83,1:28:44.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我必须来看看你是否安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l had to see you were safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.54,1:28:49.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我记得你说在这没法保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l thought you couldn't protect me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.58,1:28:51.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我不在乎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess l don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.05,1:28:57.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会伤害她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I’m not gonna hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.93,1:29:00.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的  你只是一个无害的吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're just a harmless Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.93,1:29:04.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是另外一个  因为你们她想杀了贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m talking about the other bloodsucker who tried to kill Bella because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.43,1:29:05.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,维多利亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Victoria？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.56,1:29:07.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,维多利亚一直在附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Victoria's been around.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.77,1:29:09.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没看见过她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l didn't see her.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.02,1:29:13.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也没看见有人从水里把你救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l didn't see you get pulled out of the water, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.48,1:29:17.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看不见你和你那群狗杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l can't see past you and your pack of mutts.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.53,1:29:19.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你最好别惹我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get me upset…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.74,1:29:23.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不然大家都不好看  - 别闹了  停  停  停  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- …or things are gonna get very ugly.  - Hey, stop. Stop, stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.29,1:29:31.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们先聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ll give you a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.38,1:29:41.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不会走的  你还会回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going anywhere. You're gonna come back,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.05,1:29:44.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 对吧  - 只要你把狗赶走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- right？ - As soon as you put the dog out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.86,1:29:55.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,他来了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.36,1:30:00.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他人吗  科林一家回来了几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there others？ How many Cullens are here
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.99,1:30:03.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,要待多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and how long are they staying？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.24,1:30:04.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.24,1:30:06.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s just Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.62,1:30:14.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,她愿意待多久就待多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she can stay as long as she'd like.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.88,1:30:19.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他人还回来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, are the rest coming back？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.51,1:30:26.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.43,1:30:29.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,据我所知  不回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that l know of.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.06,1:30:32.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.90,1:30:38.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.44,1:30:44.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果没事你最好赶快回山姆那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if that's all, then you'd better go run back to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.20,1:30:48.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我又这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ve done it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.95,1:30:52.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,总是违背承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l keep breaking my promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.38,1:31:00.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,咱们两个没必要这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to do this to each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.59,1:31:06.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,咱们有必要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.98,1:31:19.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.21,1:31:43.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里是斯旺家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swan residence.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.60,1:31:51.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.39,1:31:54.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,他去安排葬礼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's arranging a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.24,1:32:11.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.16,1:32:13.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.29,1:32:15.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,总来碍事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.25,1:32:18.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,到底是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.54,1:32:20.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  你别管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, step back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.25,1:32:23.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 雅各布  是谁  - 贝拉  刚才是爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jake, who was that？ - Bella！Bella, it's Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.05,1:32:27.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,他以为你死了  罗莎莉告诉了他我来这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks you're dead. Rosalie told him why l came here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.68,1:32:32.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要…你为什么不让我跟他说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you…Why didn't you let me speak to him？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.47,1:32:33.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他没有找你  - 贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He didn't ask for you.  - Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.72,1:32:37.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不管  - 贝拉  贝拉  他要去找沃尔图里家族了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- l don't care！ - Bella. Bella！He's going to the Volturi.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.98,1:32:39.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,他也想去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to die, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.82,1:32:44.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,是他抛弃你的  他离开了你  记得吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left you, Bella.  He didn't want you anymore. Remember？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.03,1:32:48.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我不能让他心怀内疚的去自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I’m not gonna let him kill himself out of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.20,1:32:51.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你爸爸怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.58,1:32:54.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经18岁了  法律上讲我来去自由  我还留了字条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m 18. I’m legally free to go, and l left a note.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.75,1:32:58.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你了  贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Bella,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.92,1:33:02.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,别走好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.75,1:33:05.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.09,1:33:09.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,或是为了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.68,1:33:12.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我必须得去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.19,1:33:19.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.61,1:33:23.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,别走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.73,1:33:27.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,再见  雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.87,1:33:37.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.52,1:34:40.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,你心意已决吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you've made up your minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.10,1:34:43.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的天赋如此珍贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m afraid your particular gifts
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.69,1:34:47.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,不应该被毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are too valuable to destroy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.98,1:34:52.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果对命运不甘心  可以加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you're unhappy with your lot, join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.99,1:34:57.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能为我们效力  我们会非常高兴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We would be delighted to utilize your skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.66,1:35:01.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不想留下来和我们待在一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't you consider staying with us？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.00,1:35:05.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道最终的结果是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it will happen anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.42,1:35:07.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,有因就有果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.59,1:35:13.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.39,1:35:22.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,这辆车不是你租来的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m guessing you didn't rent this car？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.27,1:35:24.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我猜你应该不会反对偷车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l figured you wouldn't be opposed to grand theft auto.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.39,1:35:25.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,今天不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.11,1:35:30.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  你看见什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What？What do you see？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.86,1:35:32.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们拒绝了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They refused him.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.82,1:35:35.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 那会怎样  - 他准备现身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So？ - He's gonna make a scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.57,1:35:38.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 在众人面前暴露自己的身份  - 不  什么时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Show himself to the humans.  - No！When？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.45,1:35:42.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,他会一直等到中午  太阳最高的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna wait until noon, when the sun's at its highest.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.25,1:35:46.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝  你最好快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, Alice, you got to hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.54,1:35:48.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我特拉城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's Volterra.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.19,1:36:16.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们为什么都穿红色的衣服  - 圣马可斯节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are they all in red？ - San Marco's Day festival.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.11,1:36:18.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了庆祝吸血鬼被驱逐出这个城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're commemorating the expulsion of vampires from the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.99,1:36:20.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,这情况对咱们有利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s the perfect setting.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.41,1:36:22.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔图里家族不会让他露出真实面貌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Volturi will never let him get far enough to reveal himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.04,1:36:24.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有5分钟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.83,1:36:27.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  放松点  深呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know, Bella, just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.21,1:36:34.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.30,1:36:36.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是唯一一个他预见不到的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, you're the only one he can't see coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.55,1:36:39.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我去了  他会知道我的想法  会觉得我欺骗他而迫不及待去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf l go, he'll read my thoughts. He'll think I’m lying. He'll rush into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.39,1:36:43.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我该去哪  - 他就在钟塔下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where do l go？ - He'll be under the clock tower. Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.17,1:38:37.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.59,1:38:40.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是天堂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.80,1:38:42.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,赶快进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.30,1:38:46.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛  看看我  我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your eyes. Look at me. I’m alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.85,1:38:48.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,你必须赶快进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to move.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.43,1:38:50.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.15,1:39:00.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 是你  - 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're here.  - I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.11,1:39:04.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.78,1:39:08.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.46,1:39:21.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你再一次看到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l needed to make you see me once.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.09,1:39:23.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,必须得让你知道我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had to know that l was alive,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.47,1:39:26.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不必为任何事感到愧疚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you didn't have to feel guilty about anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.47,1:39:32.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我可以让你走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l can let you go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.81,1:39:38.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我做的一切都不是出于愧疚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l never acted out of guilt.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.44,1:39:44.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是  没有你  我活不下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l just couldn't live in a world where you don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.32,1:39:48.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 但你说过…- 我撒谎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But you said…  - l lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.08,1:39:52.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只能撒谎  而你如此轻易地相信了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l had to lie. But you believed me so easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.83,1:40:01.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不可能爱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it doesn't make sense for you to love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.13,1:40:07.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都不是  只是平凡的人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l mean, I’m nothing. I’m human. I’m nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.93,1:40:12.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  你就是我的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, you're everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.48,1:40:16.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.88,1:40:43.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要你们的帮忙了  先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l won't be needing your services after all, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.05,1:40:46.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,埃罗想要再和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro wants to speak with you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.22,1:40:47.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没破坏任何法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No rules were broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.55,1:40:51.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,尽管如此  不过咱们最好还是换个地方谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nonetheless, we should take this conversation to a more appropriate venue.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.81,1:40:53.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.39,1:40:56.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  你去和大家一起欢度节日吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, why don't you go and enjoy the rest of the festival？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.81,1:40:58.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,这女孩得和咱们一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl comes with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.23,1:40:59.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,不行  想都别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You can go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.32,1:41:03.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,别这样  伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.15,1:41:07.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是个节日嘛  不想引人围观吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s a festival. You wouldn't want to make a scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.41,1:41:09.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.20,1:41:11.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.08,1:41:14.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,珍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.04,1:41:18.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,埃罗派我来看一下为什么这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro sent me to see what was taking so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.09,1:41:28.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,按她说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do as she says.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.60,1:41:41.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.98,1:41:47.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.61,1:41:49.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.91,1:41:51.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.43,1:42:25.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.57,1:42:32.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是人类吗  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is she human？ - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.87,1:42:37.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,她知道这一切吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does she know？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.99,1:42:39.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.50,1:42:41.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,那她为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, why would…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.92,1:42:44.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,想要成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.17,1:42:46.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,她会变成吸血鬼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so she will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.67,1:42:48.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,或是甜点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or dessert.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.60,1:43:00.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,妹妹  让你去找一个你却带回来两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister. They send you out to get one and you bring back two.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.14,1:43:02.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有半个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a half.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.77,1:43:05.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,太聪明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a clever girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.23,1:43:07.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,多么令人惊喜啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a happy surprise！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.19,1:43:10.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉竟然还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella is alive after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.74,1:43:14.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,实在是太美妙了  不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that wonderful？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.53,1:43:17.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢大团圆结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l love a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.87,1:43:23.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,太稀有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are so rare.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.71,1:43:30.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的小歌手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}La Tua Cantante(Your Singer)
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.55,1:43:33.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的血液太诱人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her blood appeals to you so much
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.34,1:43:36.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我充满渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it makes me thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.43,1:43:39.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么做到的能离她这么近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you stand to be so close to her？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.39,1:43:42.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是那么容易  - 我能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It’s not without difficulty.  - Yes, l can see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.81,1:43:49.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,埃罗通过触摸就可以读出我的所有想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aro can read every thought I’ve ever had with one touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.40,1:43:52.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在所有的事你都知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you know everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.24,1:43:55.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就继续吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.16,1:44:01.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,你自己也是个不错的读心者  爱德华\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are quite a soul reader yourself, Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.00,1:44:07.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,虽然你无法知道贝拉在想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though you can't read Bella's thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.67,1:44:12.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.68,1:44:21.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想看看  你是否也能屏蔽我的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l would love to see if you are an exception to my gifts, as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.77,1:44:25.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是否有这样的荣幸呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you do me the honor？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.79,1:44:48.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.38,1:44:51.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都读不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l see nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.30,1:45:02.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l wonder if…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.68,1:45:06.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,她是否对所有的能力都免疫呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us see if she's immune to all our powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.23,1:45:09.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,可以试试吗  珍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we, Jane？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.56,1:45:13.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 不要  - 痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No！ - Pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.33,1:45:30.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.50,1:45:33.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop！Please！Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.34,1:45:37.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你了  别再伤害他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop！Just stop hurting him！Please！Please！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.88,1:45:40.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,珍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jane？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.22,1:45:43.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.81,1:45:49.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续吧  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.02,1:45:57.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,这可能会有些疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This may hurt just a little.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.38,1:46:14.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,太不寻常了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remarkable！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.09,1:46:19.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,她击败了咱们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She confounds us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.38,1:46:23.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么我们该如何处置你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do we do with you now？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.10,1:46:27.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你该怎么做的  埃罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already know what you're going to do, Aro.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.22,1:46:30.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,她知道的太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knows too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.60,1:46:32.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,她是个麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a liability.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.36,1:46:37.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.78,1:46:43.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,菲利克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felix？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.95,1:46:48.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.60,1:47:52.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,别这样  求你  不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please！No！No！Please, please！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.56,1:47:58.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀了我吧  饶了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill me！Kill me！Not him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.70,1:48:12.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,多么伟大啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.96,1:48:18.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,你居然愿意为我们这种人放弃生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would give up your life for someone like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.50,1:48:20.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,为一个吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.26,1:48:24.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个没有灵魂的恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A soulless monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.76,1:48:26.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,离她远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get away from her！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.85,1:48:35.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不了解他的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know a thing about his soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.31,1:48:46.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个之中肯定要死一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's one or the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.90,1:48:48.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是太悲哀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a sadness.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.74,1:48:54.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,除非你主动赐予她长生不老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf only it were your intention to give her immortality.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.21,1:49:04.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.13,1:49:08.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉将会成为咱们的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella will be one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.93,1:49:11.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我预见到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ve seen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.22,1:49:15.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会亲自将她变成吸血鬼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ll change her myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.05,1:49:50.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,太美妙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mesmerizing.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.97,1:49:55.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,能预见未发生之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To see what you have seen before it has happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.31,1:50:02.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的能力将会让你成为一个迷人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your gifts will make for an intriguing
