Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.53,1:50:08.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊莎贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isabella.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.95,1:50:14.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.08,1:50:17.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,去做准备吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make your preparations.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.83,1:50:19.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们来把事情完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us be done with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.67,1:50:23.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,海迪随时都会去拜访你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heidi will arrive any moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.80,1:50:29.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你们的来访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for your visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.30,1:50:30.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们也会回访的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.93,1:50:33.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我建议你们及早实现诺言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l would advise that you follow through on your promise soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.97,1:50:36.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会给第二次机会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not offer second chances.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.97,1:50:41.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,再见了  我年轻的朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, my young friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.44,1:50:49.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,收获不小嘛  海迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice fishing, Heidi.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.32,1:50:51.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,看起来相当美味多汁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they do look rather juicy.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.65,1:50:53.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我留点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save some for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.32,1:50:57.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,请走这边  不要走散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, please. Stay together.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.80,1:51:13.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,不  不 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop！Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.19,1:51:25.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.77,1:51:29.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,放心睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.15,1:51:35.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候醒来我都会守在你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ll still be here when you wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.37,1:51:42.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  我当初离开的唯一原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, the only reason l left
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.21,1:51:47.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,只是想要保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was because l thought l was protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.00,1:51:50.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l needed you
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.71,1:51:54.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,像普通人一样快乐的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have a chance at a normal, happy life.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.76,1:52:01.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,你如此轻易就离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was so easy for you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.73,1:52:07.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,离开你是我100年来做过的最痛苦的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving you was the hardest thing I’ve done in 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.20,1:52:15.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l swear,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.07,1:52:19.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,永远不会再让你失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l will never fail you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.04,1:52:23.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.00,1:52:27.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 查理来了  - 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Charlie's coming.  - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.09,1:52:32.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.88,1:52:35.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.26,1:52:40.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,爸  你不用担心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad, you don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.93,1:52:42.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,上次你也是这样说  然后就失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, last time you said that, you took off.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.02,1:52:45.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,整整三天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l didn't see you for three days.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.89,1:52:48.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道错了  爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m really sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.57,1:52:54.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  再也不许这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, do not ever do that to me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.11,1:52:58.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,永远都不许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.99,1:53:02.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你被禁足了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're grounded
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.04,1:53:05.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,直到死为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.33,1:53:07.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.80,1:53:20.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,严格说来我没有违反他的规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m not technically breaking any of his rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.60,1:53:26.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说过  我不能踏进门口一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did say l couldn't take a step inside the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.31,1:53:29.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是从窗子进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l came in through the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.23,1:53:35.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不会轻易原谅我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not gonna forgive me easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.20,1:53:39.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l know.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.53,1:53:42.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.66,1:53:48.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l hope you can,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.04,1:53:52.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,没了你我真不知道该怎么活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause l honestly don't know how to live without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.59,1:53:58.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.65,1:54:18.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,一旦爱丽丝把我改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once Alice changes me,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.53,1:54:23.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就再也别想抛下我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can't get rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.91,1:54:27.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,她不一定要转变你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't need to change you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.83,1:54:31.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他方法可以保住沃尔图里的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are always ways to keep the Volturi in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.04,1:54:35.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.22,1:54:44.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们都知道我想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all know what l want.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.39,1:54:49.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也知道我的要求很过分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l know how much I’m asking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.64,1:54:55.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,我认为唯一公平的方法就是大家投票表决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing that l can think of for it to be fair is to just vote.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.23,1:54:58.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在瞎说什么  - 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't know what you're talking about.  - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.19,1:55:01.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alice？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.86,1:55:04.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经当你是姐妹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l already consider you my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.20,1:55:09.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我同意  - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes.  - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.91,1:55:11.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l vote "yes."
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.83,1:55:16.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用一直想要杀你应该会很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be nice to not want to kill you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.34,1:55:20.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.59,1:55:25.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,对于以前的所作所为我感到非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m really sorry to both of you for how I've acted,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.35,1:55:28.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,同时  我也非常感激你勇敢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I’m really grateful that you were brave enough
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.47,1:55:30.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,救出了我的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to go and save my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.10,1:55:35.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,但这不是我会选择的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this isn't a life l would have chosen for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.11,1:55:41.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果是我  我希望有人会阻止我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And l wish that there'd been someone to vote "no" for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.66,1:55:46.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以  我反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.49,1:55:49.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我当然同意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I vote "Hell, yeah".
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.29,1:55:53.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,咱们可以一起和沃尔图里干一架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we can pick a fight with these Volturi some other way.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.75,1:55:56.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我早就当你是一家人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already consider you a part of the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.33,1:55:58.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.47,1:56:06.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这样对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this to me？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.39,1:56:09.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this means.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.81,1:56:13.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有她你就不活了  这让我别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've chosen not to live without her, which leaves me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.44,1:56:16.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不想失去我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't lose my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.53,1:56:26.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想等到毕业以后  这样查理会比较容易接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’ll wait until after graduation to make it easier on Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.58,1:56:34.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华  我希望由你亲自完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edward, I want you to be the one to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.50,1:56:43.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,他想和我谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.72,1:56:48.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你现在还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're still alive for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.43,1:56:50.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,他认为  是我把你带走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks it's me keeping you away.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.97,1:56:53.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈别偷听我的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay the hell out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.56,1:56:58.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各布  我知道你有话对我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, I know you have something to say to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.40,1:57:04.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意让我先说点什么吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But l want to say something to you first, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.44,1:57:06.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.99,1:57:13.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你在我不在的时候保护她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for keeping Bella alive when I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.91,1:57:16.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不用客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.04,1:57:20.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我保护她不是因为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it wasn't for your benefit, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.75,1:57:22.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还是很感激你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m still grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.21,1:57:24.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在我回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I’m here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.51,1:57:27.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,除非她赶我走  否则我不会离开她半步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m not gonna leave her side until she orders me away.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.30,1:57:28.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,走着瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.51,1:57:33.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,该轮到我说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, my turn to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.23,1:57:41.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我来是想提醒你别忘了协议里的重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I’m here to remind you about a key point in the treaty.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.94,1:57:43.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.90,1:57:45.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What key point？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.69,1:57:47.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们咬了人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lf any of them bites a human,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.74,1:57:50.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,停战协议就会结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the truce is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.91,1:57:53.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我是自愿的就与你无关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if I choose it, it has nothing to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.83,1:57:55.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.45,1:57:59.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不能变成和他们一样  贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna be one of them, Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.96,1:58:01.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,这你管不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s not up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.59,1:58:04.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们会怎样对你  我别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what we'll do to you. I won't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.00,1:58:06.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  咱们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, please, come.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.76,1:58:07.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.93,1:58:12.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,他会伤害我吗  读下他的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he gonna hurt me？Read his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.85,1:58:21.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.61,1:58:29.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.95,1:58:35.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以  求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, please,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.16,1:58:42.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要逼我做抉择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't make me choose,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.01,1:58:49.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为我一定会选择他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause it'll be him.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.30,1:58:55.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我永远都会选他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It’s always been him.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.65,1:59:03.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.78,1:59:14.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见  雅各布  - 不用你替她做主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Goodbye, Jacob.  - No, you don't speak for her！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.66,1:59:21.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉  咱们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bella, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.46,1:59:24.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.00,1:59:28.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.38,1:59:31.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们之中任何一人受伤  我都会难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't hurt each other without hurting me.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.48,1:59:51.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,雅各\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jake.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.67,2:00:08.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.21,2:00:11.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不该变成我这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't become what l am.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.55,2:00:18.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你做不到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.22,2:00:23.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,求你等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, please, just wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.19,2:00:32.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我五年的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me five years.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.41,2:00:40.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,这太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too long.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.54,2:00:46.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么三年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then three？
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.71,2:00:52.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真是固执\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.38,2:00:56.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你到底要等什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.23,2:01:08.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要我亲自去做的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}l have one condition
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.77,2:01:13.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只有一个条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want me to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.36,2:01:19.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,什么条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the condition？
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.78,2:01:21.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要永远在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.29,2:01:25.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,这正是我想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I’m asking.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.51,2:01:38.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,嫁给我吧  贝拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marry me, Bella.
